</head> <body> <noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-5N92M4D" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript><?php include_once('header.php'); ?> <div class="inner-pages-bnr"> <img src="images/bharat/csr-banner2.png" class="img-responsive" alt="contact-banner-image"> <div class="banner-caption"> <h1>CSR</h1> <ul class="breadcumb"> <li><a href="index.php">Home</a> - </li><li>CSR</li></ul> </div></div><section class="pad60-top-bottom"> <div class="container-fluid"> <div class="row"> <div class="container"> <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 pull-right"> <div class="csr-img"> <span class="image_hover"> <img src="images/bharat/3.jpg" alt="Avatar" class="imagee zoom_img_effect img-responsive"> </span> </div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"> <div class="csr-text"> <h3 class="tsh">Sustainability</h3> <p class="tsp">We believe that it is the responsibility of each one of us to help create a better world by enriching lives of individuals and communities around us. We devote special attention to the environment in which we work. While complying with all legal and statutory laws we make sure to use the resources around us wisely, efficiently, and responsibly; reduce global carbon footprint, and protect the environment for the future.</p><p class="tsp">As a testimony to our efforts, we won the highly coveted Environment Excellence Award , a rare and commendable feat in the Foundry Industry.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section> <section class="pad45-top-bottom"> <div class="container-fluid"> <div class="row"> <div class="container"> <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-lg-6 esus"> <img src="images/bharat/visi2.png" alt="visi" class="img-responsive ovl"> <h3 class="tsvl">Environmental Sustainability</h3> <div> <p class="tscv">Our vision is to create an environmentally sustainable business through efficient and effective use of natural and scarce resources around us. This will enable us to derive value for our communities.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-lg-6 imus"> <img src="images/bharat/misi2.png" alt="visi" class="img-responsive ovr"> <h3 class="tsvr">Imparting Education</h3> <div> <p class="tscv">We aim to impart education to the under-privileged section of the society in order to prepare them for a competitive market place. In this endeavour, we not only offer monetary assistance and mentoring but also rich industrial exposure thereby preparing individuals for a better and impactful future.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section> <section class="pad5-top-bottom"> <div class="container-fluid"> <div class="row"> <div class="container"> <h3 class="tsh">Eco System</h3> <p class="tsp">We all have an impact on the environment through our use of resources and burning fossil fuels to meet our day to day business activities. We can make a real difference given each one of us makes environmentally sustainable choices. We at Bharat Engineering Works, are committed to reducing carbon foot print and doing business in an environment friendly way. The hallmarks of our environment-friendly business endeavours are implementation of the following programmes:</p><ul class="timeline"> <li> <div class="timeline-image"> <img class="img-circle img-responsive" src="images/bharat/Gallery/certificates/open.png" alt="Image"> </div><div class="timeline-panel"> <div class="timeline-heading"> <h4 class="subheading">Greenery and adequate open space : </h4> </div><div class="timeline-body"> <p class="text-muted"> Almost 60% of our land bank is either open space or dedicated greenbelt. This helps to minimize dust, Carbon Dioxide, and other aerial pollution to low levels. No wonder why our green belt is home to a quite a few animal species and migratory birds. </p></div></div><div class="line"></div></li><li class="timeline-inverted"> <div class="timeline-image"> <img class="img-circle img-responsive" src="images/bharat/Gallery/certificates/rain.png" alt="rain"> </div><div class="timeline-panel"> <div class="timeline-heading"> <h4 class="subheading">Rain Water harvesting : </h4> </div><div class="timeline-body"> <p class="text-muted"> Water is a precious resource. We should always use it wisely because it’s not as abundant as we might think. In order to conserve water we rigorously leverage rain water harvesting techniques and at the same time minimise the depletion of ground water. </p></div></div><div class="line"></div></li><li> <div class="timeline-image"> <img class="img-circle img-responsive" src="images/bharat/Gallery/certificates/solar.png" alt="Solar"> </div><div class="timeline-panel"> <div class="timeline-heading"> <h4 class="subheading">Solar Power : </h4> </div><div class="timeline-body"> <p class="text-muted"> Unlike fossil fuels, solar energy makes a positive impact on the environment. As a responsible global citizen we make use of Solar Power to create clean and green foundry. </p></div></div></li></ul> </div></div></div></section> <?php include_once('footer.php'); ?>  <script src="js/jquery.min.js"></script> <script src="js/bootstrap.min.js"></script> <script src="js/custom.js"></script> <script src="js/theme.js"></script> </body></html>